{"displayStem":"유도 II의 연속 10초 기록을 0–5초와 5–10초 두 줄로 나누어 표시하였다. 두 줄은 중복되거나 생략된 시간이 없다. 합성 파형이며 단일 유도의 P파 모양만으로 특정 부정맥을 확진하는 문항은 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 심전도 · 유도 II · 10 mm/mV","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg class=\"c03-p2-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 650\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교정 눈금이 있는 교육용 합성 심전도 비교\"><text x=\"18\" y=\"30\">유도 II · 10 mm/mV</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"100\">가 · 25 mm/s</text><path d=\"M84 120v140\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></path><path d=\"M88 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M92 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M96 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M100 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M104 120v140\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></path><path d=\"M108 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M112 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M116 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M120 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M124 120v140\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></path><path d=\"M128 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M132 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M136 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M140 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M144 120v140\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></path><path d=\"M148 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M152 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M156 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M160 120v140\" stroke=\"#ddd\" stroke-width=\"0.45\"></path><path d=\"M164 120v140\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\